      "content": "Subject: Discrepancy in Resin Invoice and Request for Credit Memo\n\nDear [Supplier's Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to address a recent invoice we received for our last month's resin order. Upon reviewing the invoice, we noticed a discrepancy in the quantity billed. We were charged for 500kg more resin than we actually received. \n\nWe value our partnership and believe in maintaining a transparent and honest relationship. Therefore, we kindly request an explanation for this discrepancy. Could you please provide us with the details of the order and the reasons behind the additional 500kg charge? \n\nAdditionally, we would appreciate it if you could issue a credit memo to correct the balance. This will help us maintain our records accurately and ensure our financial transactions are in order.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter. We look forward to your response and a swift resolution to this issue.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Your Company Name]",
